"The model (%(model)s) of this list is not valid (it may have been renamed/"
"deleted). Please re-insert a new list."
msgstr ""
"ໂມເດວ (%(model)s) ຂອງລາຍການນີ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່/ລຶບຖິ້ມ). ກະລຸນາແຊກລາຍການໃໝ່ຄືນ."

#. module: spreadsheet_edition
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_edition/static/src/bundle/pivot/side_panels/pivot_details_side_panel.js:0
msgid ""
"The model (%(model)s) of this pivot is not valid (it may have been renamed/"
"deleted). Please re-insert a new pivot."
msgstr ""
"ໂມເດວ (%(model)s) ຂອງ Pivot ນີ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່/ລຶບຖິ້ມ). ກະລຸນາແຊກ Pivot ໃໝ່ຄືນ."

#. module: spreadsheet_edition
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_edition/models/spreadsheet_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The operation could not be applied because of a concurrent update. Please "
"try again."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການອັບເດດພ້ອມກັນ. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. module: spreadsheet_edition
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_edition/static/src/bundle/version_history/version_history_action.js:0
msgid ""
"There are missing revisions that prevent to restore the whole edition "
"history.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to load the more recent modifications?"
msgstr ""
"ມີສະບັບດັດແກ້ທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນປະຫວັດການດັດແກ້ທັງໝົດໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼ້າສຸດເພີ່ມເຕີມບໍ່?"

